adb-for-android
===============

The prebuilt `adb` and `fastboot` binaries are compiled from the Android Open
Source Project (AOSP), platform-tools 35.0.2:

    https://android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/modules/adb
    https://android.googlesource.com/platform/system/core

AOSP is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The build system used to compile them is:

    https://github.com/lzhiyong/android-sdk-tools

which is also licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The on-device wrappers, build scripts, KernelSU module definitions and local
patches in this repository are provided by henry5450 under the Apache License,
Version 2.0.

Modifications to AOSP sources applied by this project (see patches-local/):
  - openscreen task_runner.h: use std::packaged_task<void()> (libc++/NDK r29)
  - libbase/libcutils/libziparchive: disable fdsan tagging, which aborts
    adb server startup on Android 16
